                            "playtime_at_review": 63900,
                            "deck_playtime_at_review": 1,
                            "last_played": 1793992196
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a marvelous game. As the current best player of the game of all time, I'm obviously biased, but... it's just such a fantastic gameplay loop. Picking skills and choosing your build then fighting against others, the community with its tournaments and skillshotcity.gg stats, the fun discord... it's been a great game and a great time playing.\r\n\r\nI don't know how to make this review more informative. There's skills, there's guns and cars, there's a macro-micro element where you path and route kinda like a MOBA and try to optimally farm before fighting in the overtime, there's mindgames with other humans, it's just an amusing and engaging gameplay loop. I even hit the top rank of all time on a free to play account with less than 40 hours, so it's not really very p2w despite that being helpful too. It's just a fun game, try it out!",
